Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.24,0:00:09.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你是谁  -卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.25,0:00:10.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你究竟是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean what are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.07,0:00:11.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是侍主的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an angel of the lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.35,0:00:12.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some angel you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.29,0:00:13.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的真身\N{\fnArial\fs30}My true form
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.52,0:00:15.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是常人可以承受的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can be overwhelming to humans
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:17.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的真声也一样无法承受\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so can my real voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.40,0:00:18.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然你已经体味过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you already knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.60,0:00:20.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有少数人  少数特别之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certain people -- special people --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.29,0:00:21.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以感知我的真容\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can perceive my true visage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.89,0:00:23.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你现在容貌又是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What visage are you in now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.79,0:00:26.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个  这只是具皮囊罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This? this is...a vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.79,0:00:28.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你侵占了某个可怜虫的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're possessing some poor bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.32,0:00:29.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是名虔诚之徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a devout man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.87,0:00:31.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这正是他虔诚祈祷之愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}he actually prayed for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.05,0:00:33.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在下面那段时间一定有事儿发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something major must have happened while I was downstairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.10,0:00:34.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我无力回天你就\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I can't back and --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.23,0:00:36.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就和恶魔好上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're bff with a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.04,0:00:37.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你如此信任她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you trust her so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:40.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为  她救过我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because... she saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.91,0:00:46.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吸血  你自己也清楚那不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sucking blood? you got to know that's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.30,0:00:48.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也祈求上天能让我停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish to god I could stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.43,0:00:51.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.73,0:01:19.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.35,0:01:22.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这是在做梦  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dreaming, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.01,0:01:23.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这儿不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.31,0:01:25.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,需要更隐蔽的地方才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someplace more private.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.77,0:01:28.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更隐蔽  这会儿应该是意识交流吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}More private? we're inside my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.15,0:01:29.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.56,0:01:31.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但会被某人偷听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone could be listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.22,0:01:33.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西  出什么事儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.36,0:01:36.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到这儿来见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.47,0:01:37.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上  出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go -- now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.11,0:01:53.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他到底要说什么  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd he say, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.33,0:01:54.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么需要如此谨慎\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was so important?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.68,0:01:58.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要知道了  还需要来这儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I knew, would I be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.83,0:02:10.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么鬼来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.60,0:02:12.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像个爆炸后的现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like a bomb went off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.55,0:02:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这儿发生过打斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a fight here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.21,0:02:30.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,双方都是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between who?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.83,0:02:41.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回头看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.13,0:02:45.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉得眼熟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.80,0:02:47.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  见到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.11,0:02:49.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜曾用过相似的图形\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna used something like that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.06,0:02:52.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将天使震飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}To wish the angels back to the cornfield.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.01,0:02:56.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  就是说  卡西在跟天使肉搏得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? Cass was fighting angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.88,0:02:58.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.42,0:03:04.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.42,0:03:07.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.75,0:03:08.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.59,0:03:10.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  醒醒  卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.55,0:03:13.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛  出什么事儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's -- what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.06,0:03:15.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别紧张  先放松点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take it easy. take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.36,0:03:18.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西  你没事儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.33,0:03:21.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.09,0:03:23.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.97,0:03:25.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.97,0:03:28.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个我是指谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's "me"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.34,0:03:30.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉米啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.14,0:03:32.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字是吉米\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name's Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.05,0:03:36.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的  那卡西迪奥去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell is Castiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.62,0:03:40.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.93,0:04:02.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢点儿吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind slowing down?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.98,0:04:04.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真怕你噎着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna give me angina.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.73,0:04:06.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我饿死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.01,0:04:08.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最后一次吃东西是什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When's the last time you ate?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:10.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不记得了  数月前了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know -- months.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.56,0:04:25.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟发生了什么事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.73,0:04:27.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那儿看起来像是天使大战之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looked like an angel battle royal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.70,0:04:30.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只记得一阵强光闪过  之后我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I remember is there was a flash of light, and I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.82,0:04:33.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  就醒了过来  而且恢复了自己的意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I woke up, and I was just, you know, like, me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.17,0:04:35.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是说  卡西已经离开了你的肉体\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what -- Cass just ditched out of your meat suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:38.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真不清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.08,0:04:40.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你记得自己被附身这段时间的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember anything about being possessed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.15,0:04:41.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有的事儿都记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.77,0:04:43.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  所有细节都记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, bits and pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.32,0:04:46.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使进驻你体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, angel inside of you --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.75,0:04:48.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像是和一颗彗星绑在一起一般\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of like being chained to a comet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.83,0:04:50.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那听起来真不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that doesn't sound like much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.11,0:04:52.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那还只是概述\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understatement.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.06,0:04:54.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西说有事儿要告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass said he wanted to tell us something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.03,0:04:57.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你还记得是什么事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me you remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.89,0:05:00.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.04,0:05:03.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那你还知道些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.97,0:05:10.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道我自己名叫吉米·诺瓦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Jimmy Novak.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.71,0:05:13.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来自伊利诺伊州的庞蒂亚克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm from Pontiac, Illinois.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.23,0:05:17.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一个温馨之家\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.65,0:05:19.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,庞蒂亚克   伊利诺伊州
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.19,0:05:20.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一年前
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.49,0:05:22.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.46,0:05:27.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感谢你赐予的食物  圣洁的主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bless this food, o lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.73,0:05:29.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们将无比珍惜你的赐予\N{\fnArial\fs30}And ourselves to thy loving service,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.83,0:05:33.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们将一如既往地秉承对你信念和敬畏\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we may always continue in thy faith and fear
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.47,0:05:36.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遵父之名为圣\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the honor and glory of thy name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.34,0:05:38.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-阿门  -阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amen. - Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.93,0:05:42.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发现自己的头已经伸出\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see my head sticking out
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.45,0:05:43.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车子的前保险杠了\N{\fnArial\fs30}From underneath the front bumper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.60,0:05:44.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我双眼被蒙着\N{\fnArial\fs30}My eyes were closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.91,0:05:46.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我将头向右转时\N{\fnArial\fs30}My head was turned to the right side.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.98,0:05:50.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到我两肩上都站着一个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}And on each side of me is an angel, and, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.74,0:06:04.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没信号了\N{\fnArial\fs30}blank
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.41,0:06:29.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.74,0:06:31.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思  这家伙可是有家人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? the guy's got a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.31,0:06:34.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然是给他买张车票  让他打道回府呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We buy him a bus ticket, send him home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.26,0:06:36.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不同意这个做法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.96,0:06:39.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  他可是我们唯一的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, he's the only lead we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.58,0:06:40.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他一问三不知的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.85,0:06:42.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真相信他不知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you 100% about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.24,0:06:44.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说他在骗我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think he's lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.97,0:06:46.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你打算把他关禁闭好好审他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you want to go guantanamo on the guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.77,0:06:49.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  也许他潜意识里是清楚事实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, maybe he doesn't even know what he knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.21,0:06:53.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得至少可以带他去鲍比那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say at least we get him to Bobby's.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.03,0:06:56.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许能让他试试  催眠或是通灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe all he needs is -- is hypnosis or a p-psychic,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.55,0:06:58.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定  只不过是在他体内沉睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, hell, maybe Cass will just drop back into him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.96,0:06:59.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不这么想  老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.59,0:07:03.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  想想看  那儿曾发生过天使之间争斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, back there, that was angel-on-angel violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.23,0:07:04.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然现在我不清楚究竟发生了什么  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I don't know what's going on, 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.73,0:07:05.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但必定是大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's big,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.59,0:07:09.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能就这样错过手中唯一的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we can't just let the only lead we've got just skip out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.26,0:07:10.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.61,0:07:13.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还记得我们帮助众人的目的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember when our job was helping people --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.44,0:07:14.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不就是让他们能重新团聚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like getting them back to their family?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.00,0:07:16.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我不想帮他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I don't want to help him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.40,0:07:17.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只不过是就事论事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just being realistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.34,0:07:18.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是在想办法帮他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, hell, we're doing him a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.57,0:07:19.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何以见得\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.09,0:07:21.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我们想从他这儿探出所以然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, if we want to question the guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.02,0:07:23.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得那些恶魔会不想吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can damn well bet the demons do, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.45,0:07:28.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你俩说什么呢  我不能回家啥意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you talking about, I can't go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.28,0:07:30.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你现在可是众矢之的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a good chance you have a bull's-eye on your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.32,0:07:31.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.57,0:07:32.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是什么人来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}From who?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.35,0:07:35.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.89,0:07:36.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得了吧  别瞎扯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on. that's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.00,0:07:38.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们想要我干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they want with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.08,0:07:39.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好说  追问事实真相吧  也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know -- information, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.63,0:07:41.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经说了啥都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.19,0:07:42.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, but --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.20,0:07:43.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我的任务已经完成了  明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm done, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.76,0:07:45.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么恶魔  天使的  都不关我事儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}With demons, angels -- all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.92,0:07:47.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在只想回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.25,0:07:47.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}We understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.97,0:07:49.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我觉得你根本就不了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't think that you do understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.55,0:07:51.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被枪击过  被刀刺过再被救活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been shot and stabbed and healed,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.27,0:07:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的躯体被别人使唤着满世界转悠\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my body's been dragged all over the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.11,0:07:56.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽被神选中了  但我已经完成使命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By some miracle, I'm out, and I am done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.51,0:07:58.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我付出得够多了  明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've given enough, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.14,0:08:00.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我们只是想告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, all we're saying is that until we figure this out,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.75,0:08:03.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我们一起才是最安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The safest place is with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.68,0:08:05.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那要多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.99,0:08:10.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少得到我们搞清楚整件事为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll cross that bridge when we get to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.56,0:08:11.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.56,0:08:13.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去看望我的妻子和女儿不行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see my wife and daughter, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:14.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.56,0:08:16.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只会让他们身处险境\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just gonna put those people in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.40,0:08:17.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是说我现在成了囚犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what -- now I'm a prisoner?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.03,0:08:20.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也不想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harsh way to put it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.50,0:10:02.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.57,0:10:05.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能不能麻利点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you hurry up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.87,0:10:10.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry -- uh, this is funny to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.38,0:10:11.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大块头狱警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. big bad prison guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.95,0:10:13.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉米·麦克穆克 从你眼皮底下溜走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Jimmy Mcmook gives you the slip?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.98,0:10:15.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确很好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's pretty funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.48,0:10:17.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那时在干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you doing, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.18,0:10:18.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去买可乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was getting a coke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.25,0:10:22.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是提神的可乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it a refreshing coke?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.59,0:10:24.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we just go, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.87,0:11:15.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你到底在搞什么  -没事  我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell are you doing?! - It's okay. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.04,0:11:16.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.04,0:11:17.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.54,0:11:19.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你怎么了  -我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's wrong with you? - Nothing's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.51,0:11:21.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他叫我这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked me to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.82,0:11:24.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁叫你做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who asked you to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.55,0:11:26.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.82,0:11:28.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来表明我的信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}To prove my faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.35,0:11:29.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.82,0:11:31.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.46,0:11:33.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是奇迹啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.16,0:11:35.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Castiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.97,0:11:47.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两位好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.74,0:11:50.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geez!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.44,0:11:52.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开稳点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.45,0:11:54.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就不会提前打声招呼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever try calling ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.15,0:11:56.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like the element of surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.65,0:11:59.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你气色很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look terrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.72,0:12:01.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um...yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.05,0:12:04.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  现在说这个不是很合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the most appropriate time, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.29,0:12:06.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们让吉米逃掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let Jimmy get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.56,0:12:08.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟当事人说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to ginormo here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.96,0:12:13.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.60,0:12:15.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来有点不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem...different.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.47,0:12:21.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  我的新发型吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? I don't know. Haircut?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.11,0:12:23.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说的不是那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.65,0:12:32.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉米跟你说了什么  他还记得什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what'd Jimmy tell you? he remember anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.55,0:12:34.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛问这个  出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.09,0:12:36.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西被送回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Cass. He got sent back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.56,0:12:38.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实更像被拽回去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, more like dragged back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.76,0:12:39.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回天堂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.93,0:12:41.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是好事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a good thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.46,0:12:44.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  这是很糟糕的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. That's a very bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.87,0:12:48.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很痛苦  很糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Painfully, awfully bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.57,0:12:50.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一定把谁惹毛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have seriously pissed someone off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.44,0:12:53.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西说有重要事情跟我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass said he had something to tell me, something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.81,0:12:55.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么事  -我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.61,0:12:56.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉米知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does Jimmy know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.98,0:12:58.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为他不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.41,0:12:59.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.58,0:13:01.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管什么事  肯定是大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is, it's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.31,0:13:03.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要查明真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to find out for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.18,0:13:05.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们才去追吉米\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we're going after Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.15,0:13:08.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你一开始就不应该让他逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you shouldn't have let him go in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.26,0:13:11.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可能已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's...probably dead already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.96,0:13:52.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把药吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.37,0:13:54.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没病\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.30,0:13:56.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉米  把药吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jimmy, take the pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.07,0:13:59.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这很难理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that this is hard to understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.17,0:14:01.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他选择了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he chose me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.14,0:14:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个叫卡西迪奥的天使吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel the angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.41,0:14:04.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他跟我说过话  艾姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's spoken to me now, Ames
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.48,0:14:06.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dozen times.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.88,0:14:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你相信上帝  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you believe in god, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.51,0:14:11.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这算什么问题  我当然信\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of question is that? of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.32,0:14:13.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.05,0:14:14.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也信  吉米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.39,0:14:16.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那为什么  你就不肯相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why is it, then, so hard for you to believe
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.26,0:14:17.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们跟我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That they're talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.46,0:14:19.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉米  你是收音机广告销售员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jimmy, you sell ad time for a.m. radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.39,0:14:21.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对  他说我很特别  而且是与生俱来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he said that I'm special, it's in my blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.86,0:14:24.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么叫你与生俱来\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-what does that mean, it's in your blood? hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.23,0:14:25.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.53,0:14:28.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他只说上帝选择我做更重要的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just said that god has chosen me for a higher purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.57,0:14:29.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}To do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.87,0:14:32.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是上帝的旨意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's god's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.31,0:14:34.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,轮不到我回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really my place to question it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.58,0:14:38.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.32,0:14:47.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是上帝的赐福\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.55,0:14:50.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我一生中最重要的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the most important thing to ever happen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.69,0:14:52.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为对你来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we were the most important things
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.43,0:14:53.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们才是最重要的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}To ever happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.59,0:14:54.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拥有信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, have faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.76,0:14:56.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉米  你吓到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jimmy... you're scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.80,0:14:58.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝会赐予的\N{\fnArial\fs30}God will provide.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.26,0:15:01.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不吃药  不寻求帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you won't take your pills and if you won't get help...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.37,0:15:06.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明早就带着克莱尔回娘家\N{\fnArial\fs30}...then I'm gonna take Claire to my mother's in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.46,0:15:24.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我愿意帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, I want to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.62,0:15:26.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我会失去我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm about to lose my... my family here
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.96,0:15:28.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不告诉我原因的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't tell me how.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.33,0:15:30.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥  求求你告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Castiel, just talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.63,0:15:32.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你究竟要我干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.71,0:15:48.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.12,0:15:52.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你保证我家人平安无事  我就照做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise my family will be okay, and I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.12,0:15:57.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then...yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.15,0:16:26.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.73,0:16:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.91,0:17:21.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.87,0:17:23.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没继续找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stopped looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.88,0:17:25.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.31,0:17:29.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.48,0:17:32.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们认为你已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We, uh, we thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.79,0:17:34.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.70,0:17:45.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克莱尔  快回房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire, room, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.17,0:17:50.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能看看她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.77,0:17:54.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh...no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.31,0:17:55.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.98,0:18:00.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多有一年了  你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been almost a year, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.85,0:18:02.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.25,0:18:05.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女儿很想知道你是不是平安无事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think your daughter would have wanted to know you were okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.96,0:18:13.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在一家精神病院\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in a psych clinic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.33,0:18:17.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要在见你之前调整好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to get myself straight before seeing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.90,0:18:20.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没个电话什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no telephones, or...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.37,0:18:24.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  你说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I know. You're right. I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.10,0:18:26.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.34,0:18:31.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过一切都过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's all, it's all over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.98,0:18:33.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'm... I'm really okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.78,0:18:35.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.68,0:18:42.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾米莉娅  我一时糊涂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...I was, I was confused, Amelia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.72,0:18:45.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得了妄想症\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was completely delusional.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.69,0:18:50.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为上帝吩咐我做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thought, I thought god was calling me to something,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.73,0:18:52.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为是很重要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thought that it was important.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.73,0:18:55.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.74,0:18:57.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.87,0:19:00.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是个大笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was such an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.74,0:19:03.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天堂  地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven, hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.11,0:19:07.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本没有那些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.18,0:19:12.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我来说  你和克莱尔才是最重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing that's important to me is you and Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.99,0:19:25.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.06,0:19:28.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法挽回我犯下的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't undo what I've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:34.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我希望一家团聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I just want to come home again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.21,0:19:39.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道自己能不能接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if I can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.41,0:19:42.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在还不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.58,0:19:48.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看着办吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, whatever you're comfortable with.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.06,0:19:56.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们可以从些小事开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we could start with something smaller?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.20,0:19:58.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.43,0:20:00.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.30,0:20:01.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.33,0:20:03.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你他娘的到底去哪儿呢  露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}where the hell are you, Ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.34,0:20:06.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可不是开玩笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't funny anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.94,0:20:09.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喝完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.78,0:20:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管你在干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop whatever you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.31,0:20:14.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上打给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.48,0:20:17.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还要更多的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.79,0:20:23.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.02,0:20:24.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.10,0:20:35.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们今天吃火鸡加烤肉三明治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, we have turkey and roast beef.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.74,0:20:37.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家里就剩这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better be okay. it's all we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.87,0:20:39.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.31,0:20:41.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more than fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.91,0:20:47.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家坐下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we sit?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.35,0:20:48.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.02,0:20:58.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太完美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.19,0:21:02.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸  你不做感恩祷告么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy... aren't you gonna say grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.87,0:21:11.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不亲爱的  我想我不会再做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}no, honey, I don't think I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.20,0:21:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么哭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.31,0:21:17.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为太高兴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.79,0:21:29.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.09,0:21:30.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾姆斯  你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, ames. how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.56,0:21:31.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.56,0:21:33.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,半小时前我看到你老公在周围晃悠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I crazy, or did I just see
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.13,0:21:35.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是不是看错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your husband wander in here about half an hour ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.63,0:21:38.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.20,0:21:39.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗杰  现在不是很方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Roger, now's not a good time --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.97,0:21:41.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  真是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. there he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.60,0:21:43.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的混蛋  你跑哪里去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch. what the hell happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.97,0:21:45.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说来话长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh...long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.84,0:21:47.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过这一切都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.31,0:21:48.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.31,0:21:49.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.51,0:21:52.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能跟你说几句话么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I talk to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.24,0:21:53.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝啤酒么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get you a beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.35,0:21:54.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'd be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.35,0:21:56.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.12,0:21:58.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}get in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.68,0:22:01.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥们儿  你可真是吓死大家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy, you scared the hell out of a lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.75,0:22:04.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.36,0:22:07.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说真的  到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, really, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.93,0:22:09.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说真的么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.19,0:22:10.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人生低谷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worst year of my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.26,0:22:11.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你绝对不会相信的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you wouldn't believe a word of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.00,0:22:14.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过一切都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But... it's all okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.67,0:22:15.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.84,0:22:18.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  还没有结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, no, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.77,0:22:20.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.14,0:22:23.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会当着你的面将你女儿开膛破肚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I mean, I'm gonna gut your daughter while you watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.67,0:22:26.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.88,0:22:29.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干么什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.95,0:22:31.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他是个恶魔  -吉米  停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's a demon! - Jimmy, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.52,0:22:33.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-快跑  -停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Run! run! - stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.29,0:22:41.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-盐在哪里  --罗杰是你朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is it? - Roger was your best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.59,0:22:42.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗杰是个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger was a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.92,0:22:44.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别跨过这条线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't cross this line.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.32,0:22:45.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉米  还说你好多了  其实是病的很严重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jimmy, you thought you were better. but you are so sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.86,0:22:47.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-听着  我没疯  -离我们远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, I'm not crazy. - stay the hell away from us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.76,0:22:49.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-离我们远点  -我是说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just stay the hell away from us! - this is very, very real.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.50,0:22:51.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克莱尔  快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire! no! run!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.66,0:22:53.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别去纠缠她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave her alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.30,0:22:55.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呆在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please stay there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.47,0:22:56.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.80,0:22:58.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.74,0:23:01.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.97,0:23:03.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我说过会将她开膛破肚的  -罗杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Told you I'd gut the bitch.  - Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.96,0:23:05.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-爸  - 放她走好么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daddy? - just let her go, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.68,0:23:07.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可能会哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, me -- I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.28,0:23:10.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过那位夫人可能有别的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the missus -- she has other ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.02,0:23:12.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.92,0:23:16.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.86,0:23:18.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.86,0:23:28.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快  带他们离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}go! get them out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.37,0:23:30.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.81,0:23:38.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子你坚持不住啊  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't get it up, can you, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.91,0:23:42.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.35,0:23:50.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快  快跟上  走走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.82,0:23:52.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.63,0:23:54.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你妻子呢  -这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's your wife? - right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.53,0:23:55.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.97,0:24:07.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.64,0:24:11.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们当然没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry we were.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.01,0:24:13.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过说实话  我真的什么都不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm telling you -- I don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.71,0:24:16.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不觉得他们会相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think they're inclined to believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.45,0:24:19.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即便他们相信你  但你是个天使载体\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even if they did, you're a vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.22,0:24:21.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们还是会想知道这是怎么个原理\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're still gonna want to know what makes you tick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.55,0:24:24.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是说活体解剖  假如他们心情好的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means vivisection... if they're feeling generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.42,0:24:26.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再告诉你一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna tell you once again --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.36,0:24:28.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你让你的家人陷入了危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're putting your family in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.56,0:24:30.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须跟我们一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.83,0:24:37.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多久呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.17,0:24:40.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别跟我扯什么不会很久的狗屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't give me that "cross that bridge when we get to it" crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.97,0:24:42.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是不了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.44,0:24:43.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.44,0:24:45.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔会永远跟着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demons will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.71,0:24:48.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你决不能和你的家人在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can never be with your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.51,0:24:51.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要么离她们远远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you either get as far away from them as possible
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.18,0:24:52.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要么就自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you put a bullet in your head,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.79,0:24:54.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有这样你才能确保她们的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's how you keep your family safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.69,0:24:57.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再想什么脱身啊  回家啊的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's no getting out and there's no going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.14,0:24:59.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的还真直接啊  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't sugarcoat it, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.49,0:25:01.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是实话实说罢了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just telling him the truth, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.29,0:25:02.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须有人告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone has to.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.96,0:25:18.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子  我之前真是大错特错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...I pretty much owe you the biggest apology ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.74,0:25:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.91,0:25:23.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当然错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.25,0:25:25.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉  吉米\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.45,0:25:28.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我永远不会原谅我自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will never, ever forgive myself
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.82,0:25:30.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然让你就这样走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For letting you walk out that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.82,0:25:35.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正常人都会那么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you did what any rational person would have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.46,0:25:38.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时也觉得自己有点疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, hell, I thought I was crazy half the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.53,0:25:43.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是恶魔么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...demons, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.84,0:25:45.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.81,0:25:51.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可不可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.08,0:25:53.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还能不能回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we even go home, or...?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.08,0:25:55.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.12,0:26:00.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们两个会帮你找辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}These boys are gonna get you a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.79,0:26:02.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别问我怎么找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ask me how.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.96,0:26:05.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只管带克莱尔去卡尔和莎莉那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're gonna take Claire to Carl and Sally's
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.22,0:26:06.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,越快越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}As fast as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.43,0:26:08.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.86,0:26:14.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有你我哪里都不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I-I'm not going anywhere without you, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.53,0:26:16.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.27,0:26:18.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我在一起的每分每秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every moment that I'm with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.07,0:26:19.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和克莱尔都在危险中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Claire are in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.81,0:26:21.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不管  我们不会再分开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care. we are not splitting up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.61,0:26:24.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.85,0:26:28.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那多久呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}For how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.95,0:26:34.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用不了多久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll...cross that bridge when we get to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.47,0:26:47.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可是一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're family.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.60,0:26:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们会杀了你的  艾米莉娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will kill you, Amelia.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.24,0:26:53.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they'll kill Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.37,0:26:56.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须离我越远越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just have to get as far away from me as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.49,0:27:13.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给  这是你的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, uh... here's your car.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.56,0:27:17.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好照顾你妈妈  听到没  宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of your mom, okay, bub?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.32,0:27:46.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么他又要走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is he leaving again?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.77,0:27:56.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天怎么这么不顺\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just not my day, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.40,0:27:58.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个小贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You little bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.08,0:28:07.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚怎么回事啊你\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.75,0:28:11.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.58,0:28:15.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你几乎无力杀死恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You practically fainted trying to gank a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.62,0:28:18.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我没变弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I didn't faint.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.02,0:28:19.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是有点晕眩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a little dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.42,0:28:20.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随你怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you can call it whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.93,0:28:23.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关键是  之前杀阿拉斯泰尔你都易如反掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point is, you used to be strong enough to kill alastair.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.33,0:28:26.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而如今却连一个蹩脚恶魔都搞不定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you can't even kill stunt demon number three?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.43,0:28:27.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想让我说什么  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want me to say about it, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.73,0:28:29.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先  你的魔力怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}For starters, what's going on with your mojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.47,0:28:32.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  老是摇摆不定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's yo-yo'ing all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.30,0:28:33.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是挑衅  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm not trying to pick a fight here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.81,0:28:36.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是  你吓到我了  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just -- y-you're scaring me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.54,0:28:39.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己都大吃一惊呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm scaring myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.82,0:28:46.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.89,0:28:49.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.33,0:28:55.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.03,0:29:00.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾米莉娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amelia?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.07,0:29:06.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.14,0:29:17.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  他们盼着你独自归来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, they're expecting you to come alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.04,0:29:18.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你则顺着他们的意\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's exactly what you're gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.57,0:29:20.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们自有办法一展拳脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll work our way through the catwalks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.71,0:29:22.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.34,0:29:25.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只要保持冷静  拖延时间  让我们做足准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you got to do is stay calm and stall and let us do our job.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.15,0:29:26.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想要我保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to stay calm?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.38,0:29:28.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们谈论的可是我家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my family we're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.12,0:29:29.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  会起效的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me -- this will work.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.55,0:29:31.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白吗  没人会受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand? nobody's gonna get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.32,0:29:33.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.16,0:29:36.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我一分钟  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a minute, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.09,0:29:41.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔们不可能会想着他独自回来的  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way they're expecting him to come alone, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.23,0:29:43.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可能是个陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know this is probably a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.53,0:29:45.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.03,0:29:46.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我才打了如意算盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.74,0:29:54.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥  你这个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.18,0:29:56.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你答应过我  我家人会没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promised me my family would be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.25,0:29:58.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你答应过我  会好好照顾她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promised you were gonna take care of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.61,0:30:01.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要我做的我都做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've gave you everything you asked me to give!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.22,0:30:02.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you more!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.22,0:30:03.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我的回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the thanks I get?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.55,0:30:05.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你的作为\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.72,0:30:07.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你所谓的天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your heaven?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.06,0:30:08.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.36,0:30:11.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你答应过的  卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promised, Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.33,0:30:14.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.84,0:30:23.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真有你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Typical.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.06,0:30:42.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  你回来啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, honey. you're home.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.72,0:30:45.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.59,0:30:47.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm begging you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.73,0:30:51.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便你怎么对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You d-do whatever you want with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.17,0:30:53.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我老婆和孩子  她们只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my wife and daughter, they're just --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.30,0:30:54.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们是无辜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not a part of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.70,0:30:56.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们可是相当重要的  吉米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they're a big part of this, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.57,0:31:00.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,补充说一句  你该独自回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And p.s. -- you should have come alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.71,0:31:01.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就我一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.94,0:31:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're such a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.11,0:31:06.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你带着并非海克尔和杰克尔(动画片主角)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I didn't think you'd bring heckle and jeckle.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.48,0:31:07.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.45,0:31:11.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,计划不错  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice plan, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.89,0:31:13.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  没人能洞晓一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, nobody bats a thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.79,0:31:15.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿到刀了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got the knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.62,0:31:17.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道啥才叫好玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what's funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.03,0:31:18.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做起中年妇女啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wearing a soccer mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.43,0:31:21.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实际上我并不乐意说细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is I was actually bummed to get this detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.56,0:31:23.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿个空盆来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Picking up an empty vessel?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.57,0:31:25.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那啥像牛奶般倾泻而出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of like a milk run.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.10,0:31:26.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在来看看是谁倒在我怀里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now look who landed in my lap.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.94,0:31:28.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.27,0:31:31.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你抓了我们  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got us, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.14,0:31:32.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放这些人走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let these people go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.51,0:31:34.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.14,0:31:35.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当你的美男计不起作用时\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's easy to act chivalrous
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.68,0:31:38.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,侠义之心又开始作怪啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}When your wonder girl powers aren't working, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.08,0:31:42.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可笑的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now for the punch line --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.95,0:31:44.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人能活着离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.53,0:31:57.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了小孤儿安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waste little orphan annie.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.00,0:32:33.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.25,0:33:58.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们当然会恪守承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course we keep our promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.09,0:34:00.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也当然懂得知恩图报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you have our gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.39,0:34:04.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你效力的不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You served us well.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.19,0:34:06.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的任务完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your work is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.40,0:34:10.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在是时候回家了  你真正的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to go home now -- your real home.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.23,0:34:12.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你将在天堂里欢度余生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll rest forever in the fields of the lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.27,0:34:13.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.67,0:34:15.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安息吧  吉米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rest now, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.80,0:34:18.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  别是克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.27,0:34:20.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她现在和我在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's with me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.81,0:34:23.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是她的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.35,0:34:25.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她命中注定  你也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in her blood, as it was in yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.61,0:34:28.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}please, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.25,0:34:30.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,附我的身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, just -- just take me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.52,0:34:32.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,附我的身  求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.49,0:34:39.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得确保你理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to make sure you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.03,0:34:41.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会死  也不会老\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't die... or age.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.03,0:34:43.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这一年让你伤心欲绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this last year was painful for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.06,0:34:47.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么这一年将会轮回一百  一千次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Picture a hundred -- a thousand more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.57,0:34:50.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.27,0:34:51.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,附我的身\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.67,0:34:53.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,附我身吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.62,0:35:01.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如你所愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.66,0:35:45.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.63,0:35:49.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想告诉我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you gonna tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.50,0:35:53.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在离开这段时间我搞懂了一件事儿  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I learned my lesson while I was away, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.60,0:35:57.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为天堂服务  而不是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}I serve heaven. I don't serve man.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.01,0:35:59.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然也不服务于你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I certainly don't serve you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.85,0:36:27.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.12,0:36:28.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.66,0:36:29.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.66,0:36:30.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别憋着  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the bomb, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.93,0:36:33.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看见我的所作所为了  来吧  停车  狠狠揍我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw what I did. come on. stop the car. take a swing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.66,0:36:35.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会打揍你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna take a swing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.13,0:36:37.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么大吼大叫吧  狠狠骂我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then scream. chew me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.83,0:36:39.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不生气  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not mad, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.03,0:36:40.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得了吧  你没生气吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on. you're not mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.60,0:36:42.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.67,0:36:45.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  至少让我解释下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. look, at least let me explain myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.27,0:36:47.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.01,0:36:48.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.28,0:36:51.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't care?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.95,0:36:55.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想我说什么  我很失望吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want me to say -- that I'm disappointed?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.05,0:36:58.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我失望透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.09,0:37:00.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但主要  我累了  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}But mostly, I'm just tired, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.39,0:37:05.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.66,0:37:07.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am just done.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.77,0:37:13.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.17,0:37:15.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂  你和你哥哥最好赶快来我这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you and your brother better shag ass to my place asap.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.54,0:37:16.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.44,0:37:20.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是天启  先知  现在就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The apocalypse, genius. now, get your asses over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.78,0:37:24.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.98,0:37:27.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你的热烈欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thanks for shaking a tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.51,0:37:29.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴你们来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad you got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.32,0:37:36.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在进去  给你们看样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, go on inside. I want to show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.32,0:37:37.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.49,0:37:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题症结出在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, what's the big demon problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.20,0:37:42.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.70,0:37:45.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是为了你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for your own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.67,0:37:49.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.94,0:37:52.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.27,0:37:54.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.57,0:37:55.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.74,0:37:57.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.15,0:37:58.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys!
